    <!-- Settings / About / Paywall additions -->
    <string name="about_intro">Sukashi Map is a camera app that burns travel overlays — route text, a hand-drawn style map and the app logo — directly into your photos and videos.</string>
    <string name="about_trip_map_credits">Trip Recap maps are powered by OpenFreeMap tiles with MapLibre GL. Railway shapes derive from MLIT National Land Numerical Information (railway data). Airport data derives from OpenFlights (ODbL). World coastlines derive from Natural Earth. Japanese coastline, prefecture borders and water bodies derive from the Global Map Japan dataset (Geospatial Information Authority of Japan).</string>
